[Student "S"]
{This is companion #3 to Deal 16 and 17.

WEST again starts with Stayman, and after EAST denies a 4-card Major, 
WEST shows her five \Hs.

But in this Deal EAST has only a doubleton \H, so he 
chooses to play 3NT.}
[Play "S"]
C4

